                                "sense_id": "68c68ddb-4bd2-385f-8f0b-9530aa50e870",
                                "text": "In contrast to structuralist frameworks which seek to filter the \"essential\" characteristics of a phenomenon from the messiness of lived experience, QT sees all identity as perpetually in contest and, consequently, variable […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "739e995e-d704-36ba-b9da-7a3666c48889",
